{"id":"prudence","lemma":"prudence","pos":"noun","rank":4124,"glosses":["prudence, caution, care"],"ipa":"/pʁy.dɑ̃s/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/61/Fr-prudence.ogg/Fr-prudence.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"prudences"},"formAudio":{"prudences":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cb/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-prudences.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Mon père conduit avec prudence.","en":"My father drives safely.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"father"},{"g":"to drive","l":"conduire"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"La prudence est conseillée.","en":"Caution is advised.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"advisable","l":"conseillé"}]},{"text":"Il conseilla la prudence.","en":"He advised caution.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to advise","l":"conseiller"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Je recommande de la prudence.","en":"I recommend caution.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to recommend","l":"recommander"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"of the"]]},{"text":"Tout doit être traité avec beaucoup de prudence.","en":"Everything must be handled very carefully.","words":[{"g":"all"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"treatise"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"much, very much, a lot"},{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}